      "content": "For high-density racking, ensuring stability of pallet stacks is crucial. It is generally safe to place a pallet's center of gravity within the base to avoid tipping, and optimizing stack height reduces the center of gravity closer to the floor, improving stability. Interlocking pallets are recommended to prevent shifting and help maintain the overall structure's integrity. Remember, always follow industry guidelines and consult with experts for specific warehouse setups.",
